    "Finally, let's look at the documents topic prevalance. Basically, in each document, what is the topic distribution?\n",
    "\n",
    "As we see for \"A New Hope\", 0.999 of the topic distribution is related to Topic 3 (Python is 0 indexed, remember) which is Rebel vs Resistance fighting. That makes sense! It also makes sense for there to be near 0 topic distributions for the other topics as they're related to the other trilogies.\n",
    "\n",
    "Pick 2 more and see if the topic prevalence makes sense in context of the movie."
