  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f5cee885-9f86-440f-96d4-bb059d3f39ba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Some of the topics seem to make sense based on the episode content.\n",
    "\n",
    "However, one way to improve the reliability of the results would be to use inter-rater reliability, where multiple people independently tune parameters and/or interpret the topics, then come together to discuss and finalize the topic labels.\n",
    "\n",
    "Another idea would be to conduct expert validation, where field experts review the topics and help refine or confirm the final labels."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8a2cd11e-e215-41dc-8efd-811b24841cca",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Step 5: Limitations and Conclusions"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3b348ee6-5658-4f2c-976a-d505fc5ec268",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Limitations: \n",
    "\n",
    "Due to this being a small sample size (n = 11), some topics might not be very well separated, and depending on how you adjust the parameters, can change quite a bit. \n",
    "\n",
    "The interpretation is subjective, but perhaps the use of validators could lead to some sort of greater consensus of topics.\n",
    "\n",
    "Conclusions:\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on how we cleaned our data and tuned the parameters, we saw 4 topics emerge from all 11 Star Wars movies, and those topics were the following:\n",
    "\n",
    "1.) Episodes I, II, and III storyline of Anakin with some politics involved\n",
    "\n",
    "2.) Characters in Episodes VII, VIII, and IX\n",
    "\n",
    "3.) Fighting between the Rebels and the Resistance\n",
    "\n",
    "4.) Politics and leadership\n",
    "\n",
    "The visualization provided deeper results on word prevalence within each topic and between all topics.\n",
    "\n",
    "We also looked at documents topic prevalence, and instead of repeating all those numbers, I will just discuss Episode IV. 0.999 of the topic distribution is related to Topic 3 (Rebel vs Resistance fighting). That makes sense based on the movie being heavily related to that. \n",
    "\n",
    "The research could be improved with:\n",
    "\n",
    "- multiple people independently tuning parameters and/or interpreting topics\n",
    "- field experts reviewing topics to refine or confirm final labels\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  }
